{"id":"9e19ee25a61be95f","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-local-field.md","title":"Local Field","display":"df-local-field — Local Field","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-local-field","aliases":["58-df-local-field","Local Field"],"display":"df-local-field — Local Field","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-local-field"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-local-field</span><span>Local Field</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-local-field — Local Field"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,v,\\mathcal O_K,\\mathfrak m_K,k\\in V\">\\(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,v,\\mathcal O_K,\\mathfrak m_K,k\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> (field predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocalField}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{LocalField}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> (non-Archimedean local-field predicate defined here)</li>\n<li>All algebraic notation in the assertion uses the displayed field operations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K\">\\(+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}field}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LocalField}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,v,\\mathcal O_K,\\mathfrak m_K,k)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land v\\in\\mathbb Z^{K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}}\\land v[K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}]=\\mathbb Z\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\bigl(v(x\\cdot_K y)=v(x)+v(y)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\bigl(x+_K y\\neq0_K\\to v(x+_K y)\\geq\\min\\{v(x),v(y)\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in K^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p,q\\in\\omega\\;((N\\leq p\\land N\\leq q\\land s(p)\\neq s(q))\\to v(s(p)-s(q))\\geq n)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\to\\exists x\\in K\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq p\\to(s(p)=x\\lor v(s(p)-x)\\geq n))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal O_K=\\{0_K\\}\\cup\\{x\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}:v(x)\\geq0\\}\n\\land\\mathfrak m_K=\\{0_K\\}\\cup\\{x\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}:v(x)&gt;0\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land k=\\mathcal O_K/\\mathfrak m_K\\land|k|&lt;\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}field}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LocalField}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,v,\\mathcal O_K,\\mathfrak m_K,k)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land v\\in\\mathbb Z^{K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}}\\land v[K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}]=\\mathbb Z\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\bigl(v(x\\cdot_K y)=v(x)+v(y)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\bigl(x+_K y\\neq0_K\\to v(x+_K y)\\geq\\min\\{v(x),v(y)\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in K^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p,q\\in\\omega\\;((N\\leq p\\land N\\leq q\\land s(p)\\neq s(q))\\to v(s(p)-s(q))\\geq n)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\to\\exists x\\in K\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq p\\to(s(p)=x\\lor v(s(p)-x)\\geq n))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal O_K=\\{0_K\\}\\cup\\{x\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}:v(x)\\geq0\\}\n\\land\\mathfrak m_K=\\{0_K\\}\\cup\\{x\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}:v(x)&gt;0\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land k=\\mathcal O_K/\\mathfrak m_K\\land|k|&lt;\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom uses the non-Archimedean convention: a surjective integer-valued non-Archimedean valuation, completeness for its valuation Cauchy criterion, and finite residue field.</li>\n<li>The former <code>DiscreteValuation</code> and <code>CompleteValuedField</code> names had no definitions anywhere in the book; their content is now expanded.</li>\n<li>Since <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> has domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K^\\times\">\\(K^\\times\\)</span>, zero is adjoined explicitly to the valuation ring and its maximal ideal.</li>\n<li>Local reciprocity and Tate's thesis are downstream theorems, not defining predicates, and have been removed.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Q}_p\">\\(\\mathbb{Q}_p\\)</span>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-adic numbers; local field for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-adic absolute value</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{F}_p((t))\">\\(\\mathbb{F}_p((t))\\)</span>: Laurent series; characteristic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> local field</li>\n<li>Local Langlands: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GL}_n(K)\">\\(\\operatorname{GL}_n(K)\\)</span> reps correspond to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-dim <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_K\">\\(W_K\\)</span> reps; functoriality</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Tate, Number Theoretic Background</li>\n<li>Bushnell and Henniart, The Local Langlands Conjecture for GL(2)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S$ (field predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,v,\\mathcal O_K,\\mathfrak m_K,k\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LocalField}_S\\subseteq V^9","display":false},{"tex":"+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}field}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{LocalField}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,v,\\mathcal O_K,\\mathfrak m_K,k)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\n\\land v\\in\\mathbb Z^{K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}}\\land v[K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}]=\\mathbb Z\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\bigl(v(x\\cdot_K y)=v(x)+v(y)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}\\;\\bigl(x+_K y\\neq0_K\\to v(x+_K y)\\geq\\min\\{v(x),v(y)\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s\\in K^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p,q\\in\\omega\\;((N\\leq p\\land N\\leq q\\land s(p)\\neq s(q))\\to v(s(p)-s(q))\\geq n)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\to\\exists x\\in K\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall p\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq p\\to(s(p)=x\\lor v(s(p)-x)\\geq n))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathcal O_K=\\{0_K\\}\\cup\\{x\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}:v(x)\\geq0\\}\n\\land\\mathfrak m_K=\\{0_K\\}\\cup\\{x\\in K\\setminus\\{0_K\\}:v(x)>0\\}\\\\\n&\\land k=\\mathcal O_K/\\mathfrak m_K\\land|k|<\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"K^\\times","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Q}_p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{F}_p((t))","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GL}_n(K)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"W_K","display":false}],"bytes":2539,"backlinks":[{"id":"84dce5217e459217","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LocalField}_S\\subseteq V^9$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-local-field.md]])."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-792","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-local-field.md|58-df-local-field]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["1eb4a89b005d9cda"]}